# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and in the working tree.
#
# Oxfmt/Oxlint (apps/web) and Biome treat CRLF as a formatting error, so a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true made `bun lint` fail on every file
# regardless of what had been edited. Pinning eol=lf keeps Windows, macOS,
# Linux and CI checkouts byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
